=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Naruru (A)} at (G-10) (Veridical Conflux #01) to begin this quest.
* Go to (H-8) and interact with the targetable location **Cargo Crate** to receive a {@k} {k:Damaged stewpot}.
** The quickest way here is by going to Veridical Conflux #06 and head south past the {m:Spuks|Spuk}.
* Return to {p:Naruru (A)} and speak to her to give her the {@k} {k:Damaged stewpot}.
* Head to {z:Windurst Waters} (North) and speak to {p:Ranpi-Monpi} at (D-9).
** This is at the Cooking Guild.
* You will need to obtain some {@i:Sieglinde Putty|1886} {i:Sieglinde Putty|Sieglinde Putty|1886}.
** This can be done multiple ways. If you have {p:Alchemy} 30 you can craft it, it can be bought from {n:Odoba} in the {p:Alchemy} guild for 4,000 gil if you are an {p:Apprentice} Alchemist, or you can just buy it off the AH.
* Once you get the {@i:Sieglinde Putty|1886} {i:Sieglinde Putty|Sieglinde Putty|1886}, trade it to {p:Ranpi-Monpi}. You will receive {@k} {k:Naruru's stewpot}.
* Return to {p:Naruru (A)} in {z:Abyssea - Attohwa} to complete the quest.

